      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "191",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "合并同类项并求值：",
        "$\\frac23x^3+\\frac56x^3-\\frac12x^3$，当 $x=3$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "192",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：$(0.15+0.84\\times\\frac5{12})\\times1.4$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "193",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用数区间的形式写出不等式的解集合：",
        "а) $2<x\\le15$；　　　　б) $-8\\le x<17$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "194",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "集合 $X=\\{2,4,6\\},Y=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$。用语句“$x<y$”",
        "（其中 $x\\in X,\\ y\\in Y$）规定集合 $X$ 和 $Y$ 的元素间的关系。",
        "用列数对的方法给出这种关系并作图象。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "9．用列数对的方法给出函数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们知道，函数完全可以由数对的集合来定义，而数对的",
        "第一个元素组成函数的定义域，第二个元素组成函数的值域。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果函数的定义域是有限",
        "集，那么这个函数就可以用列",
        "数对的方法给出。图 40 上用",
        "箭头号给出的函数 $f$，用数对",
        "集合给出就是："
      ]
    },
    {
